{'symbol': 'LUMN', 'date': '2022-05-19 16:15:00', 'title': 'LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DENVER , MAY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: LUMN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS VOTED TO DECLARE A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.25 CENTS PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE FRIDAY JUNE 10, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON TUESDAY MAY 31, 2022.'}